%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f96e7e3d7333da94dbd2291bd9279fef, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialLine1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc248891f46b945abb6e150ed38da9, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: It looks like you're starting a revolution. Would you like help
      with that? After all, you'll need more than just passion to defeat those dastardly
      counts!
    seen: 1
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc248891f46b945abb6e150ed38da9, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: At the top of the screen, you should be able to see the resources
      you'll need to keep this revolution ball rolling, as well as your current army.
    seen: 0
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc248891f46b945abb6e150ed38da9, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: Each turn, your fellow revolutionaries who live in each of the
      towns you've liberated will help you produce resources. Of course, you can
      also help them produce more by building infrastructure in their towns.
    seen: 0
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc248891f46b945abb6e150ed38da9, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: However, buildings and armies are expensive, so they'll also consume
      some resources to maintain. <sprite="final_icons" index=5> Food feeds your
      army, <sprite="final_icons" index=4> Gold pays for buildings and units alike,
      and <sprite="final_icons" index=6> Lumber is used to build new buildings.
    seen: 0
  - speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48cc248891f46b945abb6e150ed38da9, type: 3}
    side: 1
    dialogueText: You'll also need to build Barracks to increase your <sprite="final_icons"
      index=7> Maximum Army Size. Liberate new counties to build more buildings and
      take the fight to the counts!
    seen: 0
